RAISE CORPSE

Necromancer only.
Usage: raise corpse [id] or rc [id]
Mana: 8
Cooldown: 120 seconds
Capacity: 3 to 12 raised creatures by level.

Eligible corpses can be raised with a level-based chance.
Successful raises have a 5 percent unique variant chance.
Unique summons receive doubled stats, HP and MP, within limits.

Raised undead earn no pet experience.
Their kills award normal experience to their owner.
Death, dismissal, logout and restart end the summon.

Use loot corpse [id] to release ordinary corpse loot.
Each eligible corpse allows one revival attempt.
